+# API Specialist Review: KAN-429 (Slice 5 Phase 4 Publish Verified Workspace/Project Settings, Custom Fields & Workflows Wiki + Docs)
+
+**Ticket:** KAN-429 (`[SLICE-5-P4][KB-GOVERNANCE-DOCS]`)  
