+++| `default_branch` | Primary branch used for agent diff inspections | Valid Git ref name (e.g. `main`, `master`) | `"main"` | Baseline target branch used by reality-checker audits |
+++| `sync_interval_min` | Frequency of automated background mirror fetch | Integer between 5 and 1440 minutes | 15 | Keeps bare mirror synchronized with remote commits |
