+## Ticket Scope & Deliverable Summary
+- **Ticket ID:** `KAN-430` (`[BUG][AGENT-GATES] Fix Unbound RLS Session Crash in Async in_app_sdk Gate Runner and StructuredRequest 60s Timeout Cap`)
